- 3.2.2 On Input (Level A)
- 3.2.3 Consistent Navigation (Level AA)
- 3.2.4 Consistent Identification (Level AA)
- 3.2.6 Consistent Help (Level A)
- 3.3.1 Error Identification (Level A)
- 3.3.3 Error Suggestion (Level AA)
- 3.3.4 Error Prevention (Legal, Financial, Data) (Level AA)
- 3.3.7 Redundant Entry (Level A)
- 3.3.8 Accessible Authentication (Minimum) (Level AA)
- 4.1.3 Status Messages (Level AA)

3 results that the automated checks could not decide are waiting for a person to review. They are counted neither as failures nor as passes.

Checks used: axe-core 4.14.0 + rampsmith-rules 0f3c9a1.

If you are not satisfied with our response
------------------------------------------

If our reply does not resolve the problem, you can contact the consumer authority in your country.

More information: https://consumer-authority.example/accessibility

This statement was prepared on October 17, 2026. It was last reviewed on October 18, 2026.
